  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for java-25-openjdk",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for java-25-openjdk fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-60589: OpenJDK: Improve Resource Resolving (bsc#1275777).\n- CVE-2026-61308: OpenJDK: Enhance HTTP Connections (bsc#1275778).\n- CVE-2026-70906: OpenJDK: Improve font loading (bsc#1275763).\n- CVE-2026-70907: OpenJDK: Enhance TLS server (bsc#1275764).\n\nChanges for java-25-openjdk:\n\n- Update to jdk-25.0.4.1+1 (August 2026 CSPU)\n + backport upcoming upgrade of timezone data (bsc#1275035)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
